ared and what is hidden.","transliteration":"Illaa maa shaaa'al laah; innahoo ya'lamul jahra wa maa yakhfaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5955.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":8,"globalNumber":5956,"arabic":"وَنُيَسِّرُكَ لِلْيُسْرَىٰ","translation":"And We will ease you toward ease.","transliteration":"Wa nu-yassiruka lilyusraa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5956.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":9,"globalNumber":5957,"arabic":"فَذَكِّرْ إِن نَّفَعَتِ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰ","translation":"So remind, if the reminder should benefit;","transliteration":"Fazakkir in nafa'atizzikraa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5957.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":10,"globalNumber":5958,"arabic":"سَيَذَّكَّرُ مَن يَخْشَىٰ","translation":"He who fears [Allah] will be reminded.","transliteration":"Sa yazzakkaru maiyakhshaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5958.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":11,"globalNumber":5959,"arabic":"وَيَتَجَنَّبُهَا ٱلْأَشْقَى","translation":"But the wretched one will avoid it -","transliteration":"Wa yatajannabuhal ashqaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5959.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":12,"globalNumber":5960,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِى يَصْلَى ٱلنَّارَ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ","translation":"[He] who will [enter and] burn in the greatest Fire,","transliteration":"Allazee yaslan Naaral kubraa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5960.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":13,"globalNumber":5961,"arabic":"ثُمَّ لَا يَمُوتُ فِيهَا وَلَا يَحْيَىٰ","translation":"Neither dying therein nor living.","transliteration":"Summa laa yamootu feehaa wa laa yahyaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5961.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":14,"globalNumber":5962,"arabic":"قَدْ أَفْلَحَ مَن تَزَكَّىٰ","translation":"He has certainly succeeded who purifies himself","transliteration":"Qad aflaha man tazakkaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5962.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":15,"globalNumber":5963,"arabic":"وَذَكَرَ ٱسْمَ رَبِّهِۦ فَصَلَّىٰ","translation":"And mentions the name of his Lord and prays.","transliteration":"Wa zakaras ma Rabbihee fasallaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5963.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":16,"globalNumber":5964,"arabic":"بَلْ تُؤْثِرُونَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنْيَا","translation":"But you prefer the worldly life,","transliteration":"Bal tu'siroonal hayaatad dunyaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5964.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":17,"globalNumber":5965,"arabic":"وَٱلْءَاخِرَةُ خَيْرٌۭ وَأَبْقَىٰٓ","translation":"While the Hereafter is better and more enduring.","transliteration":"Wal Aakhiratu khairunw wa abqaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5965.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":18,"globalNumber":5966,"arabic":"إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَفِى ٱلصُّحُفِ ٱلْأُولَىٰ","translation":"Indeed, this is in the former scriptures,","transliteration":"Inna haazaa lafis suhu fil oolaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5966.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":19,"globalNumber":5967,"arabic":"صُحُفِ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَمُوسَىٰ","translation":"The scriptures of Abraham and Moses.","transliteration":"Suhufi Ibraaheema wa Moosaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5967.mp3"}]}